const pitchSay = 'Your Symbolic Constraint Agents paper says call rules cannot see hidden environment state, and recall stays around 43 to 49 percent. In your silent-errors setting, those missed calls come back as an empty response. I would add a check on the result after each call. When it fires, your mined dependency rules could name the calls that would establish the missing fact, because in my paper the list of recovery tools was what produced the gain. Then compare four arms on that setting: no check, the call check, the result check, and both. But I would want to hear what you think is most worth doing.';

